-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
phase-rs rules engine
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The rules engine is phase-rs (https://github.com/phase-rs/phase), licensed
by its authors under MIT OR Apache-2.0. It isn't included in this repository.
The Director talks to the unmodified upstream container image
ghcr.io/phase-rs/phase-server, pinned by digest in engine/phase.lock.json.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Card data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Card text and booster data (card-data.json, draft-pools.json) are produced
by phase-rs from MTGJSON data. They're downloaded at runtime and not stored
in this repository. Card names and rules text are property of Wizards of the
Coast. This repository contains no card images; the static report pages load
card images from Scryfall (https://scryfall.com) in the viewer's browser.

